    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594480/extras/b0ade41c43bc328754dce0cb75950b2b.poster.avif?t=1729025623\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594480/extras/b0ade41c43bc328754dce0cb75950b2b.webm?t=1729025623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594480/extras/b0ade41c43bc328754dce0cb75950b2b.mp4?t=1729025623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Withdrawn is an interactive fiction where you're following the main character's routine, thoughts, memories and his constant fear of living.<br><br>You're able to influence his closure with your choices, so be aware. The simplest things in life have huge impact in our way of seeing the world and how to deal with it.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594480/extras/ec0b4e993cb7b1852b06959304e769a6.avif?t=1729025623\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594480/extras/08bf6951bacff58c2f82940fce3fb200.poster.avif?t=1729025623\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594480/extras/08bf6951bacff58c2f82940fce3fb200.webm?t=1729025623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594480/extras/08bf6951bacff58c2f82940fce3fb200.mp4?t=1729025623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594480/extras/13ecab75b61a9f37a7eadb4e942266c4.poster.avif?t=1729025623\" ><source src